«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  ExponAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 ≠ THEN "ExponAll: needs 2 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → λv Xv « λv 0 + Xv 0 + → λ X « 'IFTE(X<0;0;1-EXP(-λ*X))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<0;0;λ*EXP(-λ*X))' →Num "PDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<0;1;EXP(-λ*X))' →Num "CDFc" →Tag '1/λ' →Num "μ" →Tag '1/λ' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE λv Xv 2 →List Drop » »
»
